<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-FRENCHMAN FREDERIC GUESDON WINS PARIS-ROUBAIX CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-FRENCHMAN FREDERIC GUESDON WINS PARIS-ROUBAIX CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>ROUBAIX, France 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frederic Guesdon of</p>
<p>France won the 266.5-km Paris-Roubaix classic cycling race on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
</text>
